<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia tugrik down 0.31 pct vs dollar in week.</title>
<headline>Mongolia tugrik down 0.31 pct vs dollar in week.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's currency, the tugrik, fell 0.31 percent on Monday compared with the previous Monday, official central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia set its official exchange rate on Monday at 798.97 tugriks against the dollar, down from 796.52 last Monday.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official exchange rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
</text>
